{"4144420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ghosts in the City", "steam_appid": 4144420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP SURVIVAL HUNT (1–4 PLAYERS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a Ghost, solo or with up to 4 players in a seamless open world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE GHOST ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Ghost possesses a unique power that shapes exploration, survival, and combat. Players must cooperate and combine their strengths to progress through the adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dynamic weather, a full day-night cycle, destructible environments, and hundred of drivable civilian and military vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT, CRAFT &amp; SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find weapons, equipment, and resources to survive. Craft and upgrade weapons, tools, traps, and equipment to adapt to different threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144420/extras/f8476820a8eb7b0969b96f68ff3f013a.poster.avif?t=1787738831\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144420/extras/f8476820a8eb7b0969b96f68ff3f013a.webm?t=1787738831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144420/extras/f8476820a8eb7b0969b96f68ff3f013a.mp4?t=1787738831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNT DEADLY CREATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track and fight track wild animals, fight military forces, survive against deadly creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARKOUR GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, jump, and traverse the ruins of Tokyo using high quality animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144420/extras/e6a89113cd0ea65b240a0920fcccc135.poster.avif?t=1787738831\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144420/extras/e6a89113cd0ea65b240a0920fcccc135.webm?t=1787738831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144420/extras/e6a89113cd0ea65b240a0920fcccc135.mp4?t=1787738831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A STORY-DRIVEN ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the origins of the catastrophe through story-driven missions, real-time cinematics, and dynamic dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPEN-WORLD TOKYO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a large, dense post-apocalyptic Tokyo featuring districts such as subways, parks, ports, airports, and Tokyo Tower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP SURVIVAL HUNT (1–4 PLAYERS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a Ghost, solo or with up to 4 players in a seamless open world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE GHOST ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Ghost possesses a unique power that shapes exploration, survival, and combat. Players must cooperate and combine their strengths to progress through the adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ex